  "rationale": "73 units of Cream Bun 200G at Outlet 05 (East Bengaluru) are projected unsold before the expiry deadline on 2026-09-20; doing nothing writes off ₹4076 and a blanket 20% markdown costs ₹1753. This play uses a bundle with SKU-FULL-CREAM-MILK-200G at ₹135 for 256 consented customers (Tea connoisseurs, Dairy occasionals, Sweets occasionals, Everyday staples shoppers): expected 26 units, margin ₹305, discount cost ₹387, waste avoided ₹1441 (CI 1 to 75 units; prior n 20, measured n 0). Policy v1: \"2. Prefer bundles and transfers over blanket markdowns; markdowns are the last lever.\" The proposed bundle of Cream Bun 200G with Full Cream Milk 200G at a bundle price of 135.00 INR satisfies the bakery margin floor of 8.00% (achieving 8.75% net margin) and is preferred over markdowns by the policy. It is expected to clear 25.8 units, avoiding 1440.67 INR in waste.",
